  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Matteo generic-twist implementation (clean port)\n\nThe definitions are isolated in the Matteo` context so they cannot overwrite the untwisted solver above. Scratch cells are omitted; regression cells below replace saved-output assumptions.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Off[General::shdw]; BeginPackage[\"Matteo`\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[108]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#cc8800;padding:4px 0\">Rendering failed — if you have a custom Format rule (e.g. <code>Format[x]=Style[x,Red]</code>), clear it with <code>Unset[Format[x]]</code> then re-evaluate.</div><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">&quot;Matteo`&quot;</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
