  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ϵ1S†,ϵ2S†,ϵ3S†];\nϵ1S†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ1S†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=-ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+4*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);\nϵ2S†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ2S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-3*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]-3*ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])+6*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,2}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);\nϵ3S†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ3S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=-ϵ3S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+2*D[ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]-3*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,2}]+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*(2*ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-6*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z])-3*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,2}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+4*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,3}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);\nϵ4S†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ4S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=ϵ4S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-D[ϵ3S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]+D[ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,2}]-D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,3}]+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*(-ϵ3S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+2*D[ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]-3*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,2}])+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,2}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*(ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-3D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z])-ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,3}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,4}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
