   "value": "ClearAll[Normalisation2];\nNormalisation2[QHL_,QL_,QHR_,QR_,rep2_]:=Normalisation2[QHL,QL,QHR,QR,rep2]=\n(Limit[QHL[[1]],z->1,Direction->\"\\<FromAbove\\>\"])*(Limit[Wronskian[{QHL[[1]],QHL[[2]]},z]*(1)/((z-1)^(rep2[[3]]-rep2[[4]])),z->1,Direction->\"\\<FromAbove\\>\"])*(Limit[QL[[4]],z->1,Direction->\"\\<FromAbove\\>\"])*(Limit[QR[[1]],z->1,Direction->\"\\<FromAbove\\>\"])*(Limit[Wronskian[{QR[[1]],QR[[2]]},z]*(1)/((z-1)^(rep2[[1]]-rep2[[2]])),z->1,Direction->\"\\<FromAbove\\>\"])*(Limit[QHR[[4]],z->1,Direction->\"\\<FromAbove\\>\"]);",
