   "value": "### Matteo's full reconstruction tests\n\nThese are his independent K·Ψ versus Q-determinant reconstructions for {1,1,0,0}×{1,1,0,0}, cleaned only to make statement boundaries explicit.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
