   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Concrete state and the simultaneous untwisting limit\n\nWe use the second Bethe branch in `{1,1,0,0} ⊗ {1,1,0,0}` at weight `{2,1,1,0}`. This is the antisymmetric highest-weight state. Twists and auxiliary K parameters are scaled together, `ϕ_i=ε ξ_i`, `k_3=ε κ_3`, `k_4=ε κ_4`; this is the finite, nontrivial Paul-frame limit. Matteo's individual Q basis is singular at `ε=0`, so comparisons are projective and use ratios.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ConcreteRep,ConcreteMu,ConcreteBranch,ConcreteXi,ConcreteAlpha,ConcreteKappa,ConcreteKArgs];\nConcreteRep={1,1,0,0};\nConcreteMu={2,1,1,0};\nConcreteBranch=2;\nConcreteXi={1,2,3,5};\nConcreteAlpha={2/7,3/11,5/13};\nConcreteKappa={7,11};\nConcreteKArgs[ε_]:=Join[{ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep},ε ConcreteXi,ConcreteAlpha,{0,0},ε ConcreteKappa];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ConcreteTwistedRules,ConcreteTwistedQs];\nConcreteTwistedRules[eps_]:=Matteo`SolveBaxAll[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,ConcreteMu,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi),1,1][[ConcreteStateBranch[eps]]];\nConcreteTwistedQs[eps_]:=Table[FullSimplify[Matteo`Q[a][Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi)][z]/.ConcreteTwistedRules[eps]],{a,1,4}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Projectivize,ConcreteWeightSupport,ConcreteStateBranch,ConcreteMatteoState,ConcreteMatteoStateProjective,ConcreteClosedState,ConcreteUntwistedState];\nProjectivize[v_List,pivot_Integer]:=FullSimplify[v/v[[pivot]]];\nConcreteWeightSupport=WeightSectorIndices[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,ConcreteMu];\nConcreteClosedState[eps_]:=UnitVector[36,2]+(-eps-Sqrt[4+eps^2])/2 UnitVector[36,7];\nConcreteStateBranch[eps_]:=Module[{states=Matteo`EigenR[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,ConcreteMu,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi)],target=ConcreteClosedState[eps]},\n First@FirstPosition[Table[TrueQ[FullSimplify[Projectivize[Flatten[states[[branch]]],First[ConcreteWeightSupport]]==target]],{branch,Length[states]}],True]];\nConcreteMatteoState[eps_]:=Module[{states=Matteo`EigenR[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,ConcreteMu,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi)]},Flatten[states[[ConcreteStateBranch[eps]]]]];\nConcreteMatteoStateProjective[eps_]:=Projectivize[ConcreteMatteoState[eps],First[ConcreteWeightSupport]];\nConcreteUntwistedState=Limit[ConcreteClosedState[eps],eps->0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ConcreteDeterminantReconstruction];\nConcreteDeterminantReconstruction[eps_:1]:=Module[{repAll,weight,irrepIndex,selectedBranch,qhVac,qVac,qhState,qState,rhs,row,unknowns,sol,reconstructed,expected},\n repAll=Matteo`FindWeight2[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep]; weight=Matteo`FindGoodWeight[ConcreteRep]; irrepIndex=First@FirstPosition[repAll,ConcreteMu]; selectedBranch=ConcreteStateBranch[eps];\n qhVac=Matteo`QHVac1[ConcreteRep,k1,k2,k3,k4]; qVac=Matteo`QVac1[ConcreteRep,k1,k2,k3,k4];\n qhState=Matteo`QH2Base[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,repAll,weight,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi)][irrepIndex][[selectedBranch]];\n qState=Matteo`Q2Base[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,repAll,weight,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi)][irrepIndex][[selectedBranch]];\n rhs=Together[Matteo`OrthogRen22C[qhVac,qVac,qhState,qState,ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep]/Matteo`OrthogRen22C[qhVac,qVac,Matteo`QHVac2[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi)],Matteo`QVac2[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi)],ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep]];\n row=Flatten[Matteo`K22C[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi),Sequence@@ConcreteAlpha,k1,k2,k3,k4]][[ConcreteWeightSupport]];\n unknowns=Array[c,Length[ConcreteWeightSupport]];\n sol=First@Solve[Thread[(Last/@CoefficientRules[Expand@Numerator@Together[row.unknowns-rhs],{k2,k3,k4}])==0],unknowns];\n reconstructed=Normal@SparseArray[Thread[ConcreteWeightSupport->(unknowns/.sol)],36];\n expected=Flatten[Matteo`RBase[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,repAll,weight,Sequence@@(eps ConcreteXi),Sequence@@ConcreteAlpha][irrepIndex][[selectedBranch]]];\n <|\"Branch\"->selectedBranch,\"Vector\"->reconstructed,\"Expected\"->expected,\"Exact\"->FullSimplify[reconstructed==expected]|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ConcreteK1Paul,ConcreteK2Paul,ConcreteK2Data,ConcretePaulState];\nConcreteK1Paul[ε_]:=K1Paul@@ConcreteKArgs[ε];\nConcreteK2Paul[ε_]:=K2Paul@@ConcreteKArgs[ε];\nConcreteK2Data[ε_]:=K2PaulCoefficients@@(ConcreteKArgs[ε][[3;;]]);\nConcretePaulState[ε_]:=Module[{g2=KPaulGroup[ConcreteRep,ConcreteK2Data[ε][\"Site2\"]]},KroneckerProduct[g2,g2].ConcreteClosedState[ε]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### End-to-end checks\n\nThe first check reconstructs the full 36-component vector from Matteo's explicit Q-determinant, after restricting the linear solve to the two-dimensional weight sector. The final association checks the Q-derived state, the Paul-frame overlap identity, and regularity at `ε=0`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "concreteReconstruction=ConcreteDeterminantReconstruction[1];\nconcreteReconstruction[[{\"Exact\"}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[726]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#cc8800;padding:4px 0\">Rendering failed — if you have a custom Format rule (e.g. <code>Format[x]=Style[x,Red]</code>), clear it with <code>Unset[Format[x]]</code> then re-evaluate.</div><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">&lt;|&quot;Exact&quot; -&gt; True|&gt;</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[726]= <|\"Exact\" -> True|>",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "224b4f78-1e61-4c69-8c00-721232d449d0"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[concreteFastQ,concretePaulOverlapResidual,concretePaulLimit];\nconcreteFastQ=FastQCGData[1,1,ConcreteMu];\nconcretePaulOverlapResidual=Together[ConcreteK2Paul[eps].ConcretePaulState[eps]-(Matteo`K22C@@ConcreteKArgs[eps]).ConcreteClosedState[eps]];\nconcretePaulLimit=Limit[Projectivize[ConcretePaulState[eps],2],eps->0];\n<|\n \"QSolverBranchRules\"->Length[ConcreteTwistedRules[eps]]==13,\n \"QStateReconstruction\"->FullSimplify[ConcreteMatteoStateProjective[eps]==ConcreteClosedState[eps]],\n \"DeterminantVectorReconstruction\"->TrueQ[concreteReconstruction[\"Exact\"]],\n \"PaulOverlapIdentity\"->AllTrue[Flatten[{concretePaulOverlapResidual}],PossibleZeroQ],\n \"K1PaulRegularNontrivial\"->With[{lim=Limit[ConcreteK1Paul[eps],eps->0]},FreeQ[lim,Indeterminate|_DirectedInfinity]&&!PossibleZeroQ[Total[Abs[Flatten[lim]]]]],\n \"K2PaulRegularNontrivial\"->With[{lim=Limit[ConcreteK2Paul[eps],eps->0]},FreeQ[lim,Indeterminate|_DirectedInfinity]&&!PossibleZeroQ[Total[Abs[Flatten[lim]]]]],\n \"UntwistedState\"->ConcreteUntwistedState==UnitVector[36,2]-UnitVector[36,7],\n \"PaulStateLimitFinite\"->FreeQ[concretePaulLimit,Indeterminate|_DirectedInfinity],\n \"UntwistedFastQs\"->{concreteFastQ[\"Q1\"],concreteFastQ[\"Q2\"],concreteFastQ[\"Q12\"],concreteFastQ[\"GeneratingPolynomial\"]}=={1,Global`z^2-Global`z,2 Global`z-1,Global`w^2}\n|>",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[731]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#cc8800;padding:4px 0\">Rendering failed — if you have a custom Format rule (e.g. <code>Format[x]=Style[x,Red]</code>), clear it with <code>Unset[Format[x]]</code> then re-evaluate.</div><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">&lt;|&quot;QSolverBranchRules&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;QStateReconstruction&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;DeterminantVectorReconstruction&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;PaulOverlapIdentity&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;K1PaulRegularNontrivial&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;K2PaulRegularNontrivial&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;UntwistedState&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;PaulStateLimitFinite&quot; -&gt; True, &quot;UntwistedFastQs&quot; -&gt; True|&gt;</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[731]= <|\"QSolverBranchRules\" -> True, \"QStateReconstruction\" -> True, \"DeterminantVectorReconstruction\" -> True, \"PaulOverlapIdentity\" -> True, \"K1PaulRegularNontrivial\" -> True, \"K2PaulRegularNontrivial\" -> True, \"UntwistedState\" -> True, \"PaulStateLimitFinite\" -> True, \"UntwistedFastQs\" -> True|>",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "661fc5a8-13d8-4b31-a9f2-1e424c9432c1"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Direct confluent Q-integral determinant at zero twist\n\nAt coincident twists, direct substitution gives zero-over-zero determinants. The correct untwisted objects are the finite twist jets of a regular Q basis. For the antisymmetric branch, `Q2state = -2 (Q2-r Q1)/delta` tends to `z^2-z`; for the vacuum, `Q2vac = -(Q2-Q1)/delta` tends to `z`. The residue matrices below are built from these finite Q jets. Their leading Taylor determinants are divided by the vacuum determinant and by the projective eigenvector normalization, with no generic-twist scalar-product limit left in the final formula.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[UntwistedSeries,ConcreteDualQJet,ConcreteStateQJet,ConcreteVacuumQJet];\nUntwistedSeries[expression_,delta_,order_:8]:=Normal[Series[expression,{delta,0,order}]];\nConcreteDualQJet[delta_,order_:8]:=Module[{zz=Global`z},\n {0,0,UntwistedSeries[-Exp[ConcreteKappa[[1]] delta zz],delta,order],UntwistedSeries[Exp[ConcreteKappa[[2]] delta zz],delta,order]}];\nConcreteStateQJet[delta_,order_:8]:=Module[{zz=Global`z,r=(-delta+Sqrt[4+delta^2])/(2 delta)},\n {UntwistedSeries[Exp[-delta zz],delta,order],UntwistedSeries[-2 (Exp[-2 delta zz] (r+zz)-r Exp[-delta zz])/delta,delta,order],0,0}];\nConcreteVacuumQJet[delta_,order_:8]:=Module[{zz=Global`z},\n {UntwistedSeries[Exp[-delta zz],delta,order],UntwistedSeries[-(Exp[-2 delta zz]-Exp[-delta zz])/delta,delta,order],0,0}];\n{ConcreteStateQJet[delta][[1;;2]]/.delta->0,ConcreteVacuumQJet[delta][[1;;2]]/.delta->0}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
