      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1476]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#cc8800;padding:4px 0\">Rendering failed — if you have a custom Format rule (e.g. <code>Format[x]=Style[x,Red]</code>), clear it with <code>Unset[Format[x]]</code> then re-evaluate.</div><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">{{1, (-1 + Global`z)*Global`z}, {1, Global`z}}</pre></div></div>",
