  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Fast untwisted Qs with an effective exponential k\n\nThe polynomial entries now come directly from `BuildQs`; no Matteo Q-functions or Q-jets are used. The dual entries retain exponentials `Exp[delta kDet z]`. Linear scaling in `delta` is required, but the finite coefficient `kDet3` is an effective determinant parameter rather than the physical `k3` in the K-vector. Matching the two overlaps fixes the redefinition below. For this state the leading answer is independent of `kDet4`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[FastUntwistedQPair,FastQExponentialDual,FastQExponentDetData,FastQExponentOverlap];\nFastUntwistedQPair[mu_]:=Join[BuildQs[1,1,mu,2],{0,0}];\nFastQExponentialDual[delta_,kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[{zz=Global`z},\n {0,0,UntwistedSeries[-Exp[kDet3 delta zz],delta,8],UntwistedSeries[Exp[kDet4 delta zz],delta,8]}];\nFastQExponentDetData[kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[{qhl,statePieces,vacuumPieces,stateLeading,vacuumLeading,stateScalar,vacuumScalar},\n qhl=FastQExponentialDual[delta,kDet3,kDet4];\n statePieces=UntwistedIntegralPieces[qhl,FastUntwistedQPair[ConcreteMu]];\n vacuumPieces=UntwistedIntegralPieces[qhl,FastUntwistedQPair[{2,2,0,0}]];\n stateLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[statePieces,delta]; vacuumLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[vacuumPieces,delta];\n stateScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[stateLeading]; vacuumScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[vacuumLeading];\n <|\"StateLeadingPieces\"->stateLeading,\"VacuumLeadingPieces\"->vacuumLeading,\"StateScalarLeading\"->stateScalar,\"VacuumScalarLeading\"->vacuumScalar,\"NetOrder\"->stateScalar[\"Order\"]-vacuumScalar[\"Order\"]-untwistedPivotLeading[\"Order\"],\"Overlap\"->FullSimplify[(stateScalar[\"Coefficient\"]/vacuumScalar[\"Coefficient\"])/untwistedPivotLeading[\"Coefficient\"]]|>];\nFastQExponentOverlap[kDet3_,kDet4_]:=FastQExponentDetData[kDet3,kDet4][\"Overlap\"];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ConcretePhysicalKOverlap,EffectiveDetK3,fastExponentData,physicalKFormula,effectiveK3Formula];\nConcretePhysicalKOverlap[kPhysical3_,kPhysical4_]:=FullSimplify[First[Matteo`K22C[ConcreteRep,ConcreteRep,Sequence@@ConcreteXi,Sequence@@ConcreteAlpha,0,0,kPhysical3,kPhysical4].ConcreteUntwistedState]];\nEffectiveDetK3[kPhysical3_,kPhysical4_]:=With[{x1=ConcreteXi[[1]],x2=ConcreteXi[[2]],x3=ConcreteXi[[3]]},FullSimplify[(kPhysical3-x2) (kPhysical4-x1-x2)/((x3-x2) (kPhysical4-x1-x3))]];\nfastExponentData=FastQExponentDetData[kDet3,kDet4];\nphysicalKFormula=ConcretePhysicalKOverlap[kPhysical3,kPhysical4];\neffectiveK3Formula=EffectiveDetK3[kPhysical3,kPhysical4];\n<|\"FastStateQs\"->FastUntwistedQPair[ConcreteMu][[1;;2]],\"FastVacuumQs\"->FastUntwistedQPair[{2,2,0,0}][[1;;2]],\"FastDeterminantFormula\"->fastExponentData[\"Overlap\"],\"PhysicalKFormula\"->physicalKFormula,\"EffectiveK3\"->effectiveK3Formula,\"ConcreteEffectiveK3\"->EffectiveDetK3[ConcreteKappa[[1]],ConcreteKappa[[2]]],\"FastDeterminantValue\"->FastQExponentOverlap[EffectiveDetK3[ConcreteKappa[[1]],ConcreteKappa[[2]]],ConcreteKappa[[2]]],\"KVectorValue\"->ConcretePhysicalKOverlap[ConcreteKappa[[1]],ConcreteKappa[[2]]],\"SymbolicAgreement\"->FullSimplify[FastQExponentOverlap[effectiveK3Formula,kDet4]==physicalKFormula]|>",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1519]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#cc8800;padding:4px 0\">Rendering failed — if you have a custom Format rule (e.g. <code>Format[x]=Style[x,Red]</code>), clear it with <code>Unset[Format[x]]</code> then re-evaluate.</div><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">&lt;|&quot;FastStateQs&quot; -&gt; {1, -Global`z + Global`z^2}, &quot;FastVacuumQs&quot; -&gt; {1, Global`z}, &quot;FastDeterminantFormula&quot; -&gt; -2/(kDet3*untwistedPivotLeading[&quot;Coefficient&quot;]), &quot;PhysicalKFormula&quot; -&gt; {{1, (5*(-4 + kPhysical4))/(13*(-3 + kPhysical4)), (70*(-6 + kPhysical4))/(143*(-3 + kPhysical4)), (-2*(-5 + kPhysical4))/(7*(-3 + kPhysical4)), (-6*(-7 + kPhysical4))/(11*(-3 + kPhysical4)), (-20*(-8 + kPhysical4))/(143*(-3 + kPhysical4)), (5*(-3 + kPhysical3)*(-4 + kPhysical4))/(13*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)), (25*(-3 + kPhysical3)*(-4 + kPhysical4)^2)/(169*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)^2), (350*(-3 + kPhysical3)*(-6 + kPhysical4)*(-4 + kPhysical4))/(1859*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)^2), (-10*(-3 + kPhysical3)*(-5 + kPhysical4)*(-4 + kPhysical4))/(91*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)^2), (-30*(-3 + kPhysical3)*(-7 + kPhysical4)*(-4 + kPhysical4))/(143*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)^2), (-100*(-3 + kPhysical3)*(-8 + kPhysical4)*(-4 + kPhysical4))/(1859*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)^2), (70*(-5 + kPhysical3)*(-6 + kPhysical4))/(143*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)), (350*(-5 + kPhysical3)*(-6 + kPhysical4)*(-4 + kPhysical4))/(1859*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)^2), (4900*(-5 + kPhysical3)*(-6 + kPhysical4)^2)/(20449*(-2 + kPhysical3)*(-3 + kPhysical4)^2), (-20*(-5 + kPhysical3)*(-6 + kPhysical4)*(-5 + kPhysical4))/(143*(-2 + kPhysica