  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Projective untwisting and CG-ratio reconstruction\r\n\r\nAbsolute eigenvector normalization is unnecessary for Clebsch-Gordan ratios. Write the determinant identity as `K . PsiHat = scale Dfast`, fix one nonzero component of `PsiHat` to one, and solve simultaneously for the remaining component ratios and the unknown overall `scale`. The latter absorbs Matteo's divergent `<VacL|Psi>=1` normalization.\r\n\r\nFor the fast untwisted Qs, only the leading coefficient of the determinant Laurent series is used: `-2/kDet3` in the adjoint channel and `-288/(kDet3^2 kDet4^2)` in the singlet channel. The square-root sign in `EffectiveDetK4Projective` is a coordinate branch convention; constant rescalings of either effective k are invisible projectively.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ProjectiveRep,ProjectiveXi,ProjectiveAlpha,AdjointSupport,SingletSupport,ProjectiveKRow,EffectiveDetK3Projective,EffectiveDetK4Projective,FastAdjointLeadingRHS,FastSingletLeadingRHS,SolveProjectiveOverlapVector];\r\nProjectiveRep={1,1,0,0};\r\nProjectiveXi={1,2,3,5};\r\nProjectiveAlpha={2/7,3/11,5/13};\r\nAdjointSupport={2,7};\r\nSingletSupport={6,11,16,21,26,31};\r\nProjectiveKRow[support_List,p_,q_]:=Flatten[K22C[ProjectiveRep,ProjectiveRep,Sequence@@ProjectiveXi,Sequence@@ProjectiveAlpha,0,0,p,q]][[support]];\r\nEffectiveDetK3Projective[p_,q_]:=With[{x1=ProjectiveXi[[1]],x2=ProjectiveXi[[2]],x3=ProjectiveXi[[3]]},FullSimplify[(p-x2) (q-x1-x2)/((x3-x2) (q-x1-x3))]];\r\nEffectiveDetK4Projective[p_,q_]:=With[{x1=ProjectiveXi[[1]],x2=ProjectiveXi[[2]],x3=ProjectiveXi[[3]]},FullSimplify[(q-x1-x3) Sqrt[(p-x1)/(p-x2)]]];\r\nFastAdjointLeadingRHS[p_,q_]:=FullSimplify[-2/EffectiveDetK3Projective[p,q]];\r\nFastSingletLeadingRHS[p_,q_]:=FullSimplify[-288/(EffectiveDetK3Projective[p,q]^2 EffectiveDetK4Projective[p,q]^2),Assumptions->{p>2,q>4}];\r\nSolveProjectiveOverlapVector[row_List,rhs_,variables_List,pivot_:1]:=Module[{coefficients,scale,polynomial,equations,solution,reconstructed,residual},\r\n coefficients=Array[Unique[\"cgCoefficient$\"]&,Length[row]]; scale=Unique[\"cgScale$\"];\r\n polynomial=Expand@Numerator@Together[row.coefficients-scale rhs];\r\n equations=Thread[(Last/@CoefficientRules[polynomial,variables])==0];\r\n solution=First@Solve[Join[equations,{coefficients[[pivot]]==1}],Join[coefficients,{scale}]];\r\n reconstructed=coefficients/.solution; residual=FullSimplify[row.reconstructed-(scale/.solution) rhs];\r\n <|\"Coefficients\"->reconstructed,\"Scale\"->(scale/.solution),\"Residual\"->residual,\"Exact\"->PossibleZeroQ[residual]|>\r\n ];\r\nClearAll[ProjectiveDualQ,ProjectiveFastQPair,ProjectiveIntegralPieces,ProjectiveFastRawLeadingData];\r\nProjectiveDualQ[projectiveDelta_,kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[{zz=Global`z},{0,0,Normal@Series[-Exp[kDet3 projectiveDelta zz],{projectiveDelta,0,8}],Normal@Series[Exp[kDet4 projectiveDelta zz],{projectiveDelta,0,8}]}];\r\nProjectiveFastQPair[mu_]:=Join[BuildQs[1,1,mu,2],{0,0}];\r\nProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl_,qr_]:=Module[{matrix2=UntwistedSU2IntegralMatrix[qhl,qr,ProjectiveRep,ProjectiveRep],matrix3=UntwistedSU3IntegralMatrix[qhl,qr,ProjectiveRep]},\r\n <|\"SU2Matrix\"->matrix2,\"SU2Det\"->Det[matrix2],\"SU2Norm\"->UntwistedSU2Norm[qhl,qr],\"SU3Matrix\"->matrix3,\"SU3Det\"->Det[matrix3],\"SU3Norm\"->UntwistedSU3Norm[qhl,qr]|>\r\n ];\r\nProjectiveFastRawLeadingData[mu_,kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[{qhl,statePieces,vacuumPieces,stateLeading,vacuumLeading,stateScalar,vacuumScalar},\r\n qhl=ProjectiveDualQ[projectiveDelta,kDet3,kDet4];\r\n statePieces=ProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[mu]]; vacuumPieces=ProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[{2,2,0,0}]];\r\n stateLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[statePieces,projectiveDelta]; vacuumLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[vacuumPieces,projectiveDelta];\r\n stateScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[stateLeading]; vacuumScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[vacuumLeading];\r\n <|\"NetOrder\"->stateScalar[\"Order\"]-vacuumScalar[\"Order\"],\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"->FullSimplify[stateScalar[\"Coefficient\"]/vacuumScalar[\"Coefficient\"]],\"StateLeading\"->stateLeading,\"VacuumLeading\"->vacuumLeading|>\r\n ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[adjointRawDeterminantData,singletRawDeterminantData,adjointProjectiveReconstruction,singletProjectiveReconstruction,expectedAdjointRatios,expectedSingletRatios];\r\nadjointRawDeterminantData=ProjectiveFastRawLeadingData[{2,1,1,0},kDet3,kDet4];\r\nsingletRawDeterminantData=ProjectiveFastRawLeadingData[{1,1,1,1},kDet3,kDet4];\r\nadjointProjectiveReconstruction=SolveProjectiveOverlapVector[ProjectiveKRow[AdjointSupport,p,q],FastAdjointLeadingRHS[p,q],{p,q}];\r\nsingletProjectiveReconstruction=SolveProjectiveOverlapVector[ProjectiveKRow[SingletSupport,p,q],FastSingletLeadingRHS[p,q],{p,q}];\r\nexpectedAdjointRatios={1,-1};\r\nexpectedSingletRatios={1,-2,2,2,-2,1};\r\n<|\r\n \"EffectiveK3AtConcretePoint\"->EffectiveDetK3Projective[7,11],\r\n \"EffectiveK4AtConcretePoint\"->EffectiveDetK4Projective[7,11],\r\n \"AdjointRawOrder\"->adjointRawDeterminantData[\"NetOrder\"],\r\n \"AdjointRawFormula\"->adjointRawDeterminantData[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"],\r\n \"AdjointRawFormulaExact\"->TrueQ[FullSimplify[adjointRawDeterminantData[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]==-2/kDet3]],\r\n \"AdjointRatios\"->adjointProjectiveReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"],\r\n \"AdjointScale\"->adjointProjectiveReconstruction[\"Scale\"],\r\n \"AdjointExact\"->TrueQ[adjointProjectiveReconstruction[\"Exact\"]&&adjointProjectiveReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"]==expectedAdjointRatios],\r\n \"SingletRawOrder\"->singletRawDeterminantData[\"NetOrder\"],\r\n \"SingletRawFormula\"->singletRawDeterminantData[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"],\r\n \"SingletRawFormulaExact\"->TrueQ[FullSimplify[singletRawDeterminantData[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]==-288/(kDet3^2 kDet4^2)]],\r\n \"SingletRatios\"->singletProjectiveReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"],\r\n \"SingletScale\"->singletProjectiveReconstruction[\"Scale\"],\r\n \"SingletExact\"->TrueQ[singletProjectiveReconstruction[\"Exact\"]&&singletProjectiveReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"]==expectedSingletRatios]\r\n|>",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"765691\" data-output-id=\"50\" data-out-n=\"172\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"224\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[172]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.1698em;vertical-align:-6.3349em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.8349em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.8349em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.425em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.599em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6176em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.3102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.9973em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.3349em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"heig