in-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">429</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SingletExact</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.3349em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[172]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{EffectiveK3AtConcretePoint}\\to \\frac{40}{7},\\text{EffectiveK4AtConcretePoint}\\to 7\\,\\sqrt{\\frac{6}{5}} \\\\\n  &,\\text{AdjointRawOrder}\\to -1,\\text{AdjointRawFormula}\\to -\\frac{2}{kDet3} \\\\\n  &,\\text{AdjointRawFormulaExact}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{AdjointRatios}\\to \\left\\{1,-1\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{AdjointScale}\\to -\\frac{5}{26},\\text{AdjointExact}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{SingletRawOrder}\\to -4 \\\\\n  &,\\text{SingletRawFormula}\\to -\\frac{288}{kDet3^2\\,kDet4^2},\\text{SingletRawFormulaExact}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{SingletRatios}\\to \\left\\{1,-2,2,2,-2,1\\right\\},\\text{SingletScale}\\to -\\frac{5}{429},\\text{SingletExact}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
