  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Third representation check: unequal 6 x 20' product\r\n\r\nThis test uses `{1,1,0,0} x {2,2,0,0}` and the non-vacuum channel `{3,2,1,0}`. The expected CG ratios are computed independently by solving the global highest-weight equations. The determinant side uses fast untwisted Q-functions from `BuildQs[1,2,...]`, while the overlap side uses the corrected unequal-representation `K22C`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ProjectiveKRow,ProjectiveFastQPair,ProjectiveIntegralPieces,ProjectiveFastRawLeadingData,ProjectiveSiteWeights,ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices,ProjectiveHighestWeightData];\r\nProjectiveKRow[rep1_,rep2_,support_List,p_,q_]:=Flatten[K22C[rep1,rep2,Sequence@@ProjectiveXi,Sequence@@ProjectiveAlpha,0,0,p,q]][[support]];\r\nProjectiveFastQPair[S1_,S2_,mu_]:=Join[BuildQs[S1,S2,mu,2],{0,0}];\r\nProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl_,qr_,rep1_,rep2_]:=Module[{matrix2=UntwistedSU2IntegralMatrix[qhl,qr,rep1,rep2],matrix3=UntwistedSU3IntegralMatrix[qhl,qr,rep1]},\r\n <|\"SU2Matrix\"->matrix2,\"SU2Det\"->Det[matrix2],\"SU2Norm\"->UntwistedSU2Norm[qhl,qr],\"SU3Matrix\"->matrix3,\"SU3Det\"->Det[matrix3],\"SU3Norm\"->UntwistedSU3Norm[qhl,qr]|>\r\n ];\r\nProjectiveFastRawLeadingData[S1_,S2_,mu_,rep1_,rep2_,kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[{qhl,statePieces,vacuumPieces,stateLeading,vacuumLeading,stateScalar,vacuumScalar},\r\n qhl=ProjectiveDualQ[projectiveDelta,kDet3,kDet4];\r\n statePieces=ProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[S1,S2,mu],rep1,rep2];\r\n vacuumPieces=ProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[S1,S2,rep1+rep2],rep1,rep2];\r\n stateLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[statePieces,projectiveDelta]; vacuumLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[vacuumPieces,projectiveDelta];\r\n stateScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[stateLeading]; vacuumScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[vacuumLeading];\r\n <|\"NetOrder\"->stateScalar[\"Order\"]-vacuumScalar[\"Order\"],\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"->FullSimplify[stateScalar[\"Coefficient\"]/vacuumScalar[\"Coefficient\"]],\"StateLeading\"->stateLeading,\"VacuumLeading\"->vacuumLeading|>\r\n ];\r\nProjectiveSiteWeights[rep_]:=Transpose[Table[Diagonal[EM[a,a,rep]],{a,1,4}]];\r\nProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1_,rep2_,mu_]:=Flatten@Position[Flatten[Table[ProjectiveSiteWeights[rep1][[i]]+ProjectiveSiteWeights[rep2][[j]],{i,dim[rep1]},{j,dim[rep2]}],1],mu];\r\nProjectiveHighestWeightData[rep1_,rep2_,mu_]:=Module[{support,raising,restricted,nullspace,vector,pivot,residual},\r\n support=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu];\r\n raising=Table[KroneckerProduct[EM[a,a+1,rep1],IdentityMatrix[dim[rep2]]]+KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[dim[rep1]],EM[a,a+1,rep2]],{a,1,3}];\r\n restricted=Join@@(#[[All,support]]&/@raising); nullspace=NullSpace[restricted];\r\n If[Length[nullspace]=!=1,Return[<|\"Support\"->support,\"Nullity\"->Length[nullspace],\"Exact\"->False|>]];\r\n vector=First[nullspace]; pivot=First@Flatten@Position[vector,x_/;!TrueQ[PossibleZeroQ[x]],{1},Heads->False]; vector=FullSimplify[vector/vector[[pivot]]]; residual=FullSimplify[restricted.vector];\r\n <|\"Support\"->support,\"Ratios\"->vector,\"RaisingResidual\"->residual,\"Exact\"->TrueQ[And@@(PossibleZeroQ/@residual)]|>\r\n ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[thirdRep1,thirdRep2,thirdMu,thirdDecomposition,thirdHighestWeight,thirdRawDeterminantData,thirdDeterminantRHS,thirdProjectiveReconstruction];\r\nthirdRep1={1,1,0,0}; thirdRep2={2,2,0,0}; thirdMu={3,2,1,0};\r\nthirdDecomposition=tensorDecomp[thirdRep1,thirdRep2];\r\nthirdHighestWeight=ProjectiveHighestWeightData[thirdRep1,thirdRep2,thirdMu];\r\nthirdRawDeterminantData=ProjectiveFastRawLeadingData[1,2,thirdMu,thirdRep1,thirdRep2,kDet3,kDet4];\r\nthirdDeterminantRHS=FullSimplify[thirdRawDeterminantData[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]/.{kDet3->EffectiveDetK3Projective[p,q],kDet4->EffectiveDetK4Projective[p,q]},Assumptions->{p>2,q>4}];\r\nthirdProjectiveReconstruction=SolveProjectiveOverlapVector[ProjectiveKRow[thirdRep1,thirdRep2,thirdHighestWeight[\"Support\"],p,q],thirdDeterminantRHS,{p,q}];\r\n<|\r\n \"ProductDecomposition\"->thirdDecomposition,\r\n \"Channel\"->thirdMu,\r\n \"Support\"->thirdHighestWeight[\"Support\"],\r\n \"IndependentHighestWeightRatios\"->thirdHighestWeight[\"Ratios\"],\r\n \"HighestWeightExact\"->thirdHighestWeight[\"Exact\"],\r\n \"RawDeterminantOrder\"->thirdRawDeterminantData[\"NetOrder\"],\r\n \"RawDeterminantFormula\"->thirdRawDeterminantData[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"],\r\n \"RawDeterminantFormulaExact\"->TrueQ[FullSimplify[thirdRawDeterminantData[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]==-3/kDet3]],\r\n \"ReconstructedRatios\"->thirdProjectiveReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"],\r\n \"ReconstructionScale\"->thirdProjectiveReconstruction[\"Scale\"],\r\n \"ReconstructionResidual\"->thirdProjectiveReconstruction[\"Residual\"],\r\n \"ThirdRepresentationExact\"->TrueQ[thirdHighestWeight[\"Exact\"]&&thirdProjectiveReconstruction[\"Exact\"]&&thirdProjectiveReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"]==thirdHighestWeight[\"Ratios\"]]\r\n|>",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"765691\" data-output-id=\"51\" data-out-n=\"188\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"227\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[188]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.3149em;vertical-align:-4.9074em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.4074em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.8889em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3214em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.3889em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3214em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.8889em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3214em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3214em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3214em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.226em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3214em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.9074em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height