  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Sector-first exponential expansion from `CGGenOp.wb`\r\n\r\nThe following is the existing generating-operator technology specialized to `K22C`. Instead of forming the full matrix exponentials and projecting afterward, it enumerates only exponent monomials whose Cartan margins can sum to the requested total weight. `ProjectiveGeneratingKRow` is therefore the Cartan-restricted expanded exponential itself.\r\n\r\nThe direct `K22C` row and this sector-first row are compared exactly below. The constructor's general `ProjectiveKRow` overload is then routed through the sector-first implementation.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ProjectiveSectorZeroQ,ProjectiveNList,ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo,ProjectiveExponentWeight,ProjectiveMatrixPower,ProjectiveBraMonomial,ProjectiveExponentCoefficient,ProjectiveSingleSiteSectorBra,ProjectiveK22CCoefficients,ProjectiveGeneratingKRow,ProjectiveGeneratingRestrictionCheck];\r\nProjectiveSectorZeroQ[expression_]:=TrueQ[And@@(PossibleZeroQ/@Flatten[{expression}])];\r\nProjectiveNList[d_Integer?NonNegative]:=Flatten[Table[{n13,n14,n23,d-n13-n14-n23},{n13,0,d},{n14,0,d-n13},{n23,0,d-n13-n14}],2];\r\nProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[S_Integer?NonNegative]:=ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[S]=Flatten[Table[ProjectiveNList[d],{d,0,2 S}],1];\r\nProjectiveExponentWeight[lambda_List,{n13_,n14_,n23_,n24_}]:=lambda+{-(n13+n14),-(n23+n24),n13+n23,n14+n24};\r\nProjectiveMatrixPower[matrix_,0]:=IdentityMatrix[Length[matrix]]; ProjectiveMatrixPower[matrix_,power_Integer?Positive]:=MatrixPower[matrix,power];\r\nProjectiveBraMonomial[rep_List,{n13_,n14_,n23_,n24_}]:=ProjectiveBraMonomial[rep,{n13,n14,n23,n24}]=Flatten[UPL1[rep]].ProjectiveMatrixPower[EM[1,3,rep],n13].ProjectiveMatrixPower[EM[1,4,rep],n14].ProjectiveMatrixPower[EM[2,3,rep],n23].ProjectiveMatrixPower[EM[2,4,rep],n24];\r\nProjectiveExponentCoefficient[{n13_,n14_,n23_,n24_},{a13_,a14_,a23_,a24_}]:=a13^n13 a14^n14 a23^n23 a24^n24/(n13! n14! n23! n24!);\r\nProjectiveSingleSiteSectorBra[rep_List,nu_List,coefficients_List]:=Module[{tuples=Select[ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep[[1]]],ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep,#]===nu&]},If[tuples==={},ConstantArray[0,dim[rep]],Total[ProjectiveExponentCoefficient[#,coefficients] ProjectiveBraMonomial[rep,#]&/@tuples]]];\r\nProjectiveK22CCoefficients[p_,q_]:=With[{x1=ProjectiveXi[[1]],x2=ProjectiveXi[[2]],x3=ProjectiveXi[[3]],x4=ProjectiveXi[[4]],a13=ProjectiveAlpha[[1]],a14=ProjectiveAlpha[[2]],a23=ProjectiveAlpha[[3]],a24=ProjectiveAlpha[[2]] ProjectiveAlpha[[3]] (ProjectiveXi[[2]]-ProjectiveXi[[3]]) (ProjectiveXi[[1]]-ProjectiveXi[[4]])/(ProjectiveAlpha[[1]] (ProjectiveXi[[1]]-ProjectiveXi[[3]]) (ProjectiveXi[[2]]-ProjectiveXi[[4]]))},\r\n <|\"Site1\"->{a13 ((q-x2-x3) (p-x3))/((q-x1-x2) (p-x1)),a14 ((p-x4) (q-x2-x4))/((p-x1) (q-x1-x2)),a23 ((p-x3) (q-x3-x1))/((p-x2) (q-x1-x2)),a24 ((q-x1-x4) (p-x4))/((q-x1-x2) (p-x2))},\r\n \"Site2\"->{a13 (q-x2-x3)/(q-x1-x2),a14 (q-x2-x4)/(q-x1-x2),a23 (q-x3-x1)/(q-x1-x2),a24 (q-x1-x4)/(q-x1-x2)}|>\r\n ];\r\nProjectiveGeneratingKRow[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List,p_,q_]:=Module[{coefficients,tuples1,tuples2,weights1,weights2,localWeights1,compatibleWeights,fullRow,support},\r\n coefficients=ProjectiveK22CCoefficients[p,q]; tuples1=ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep1[[1]]]; tuples2=ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep2[[1]]]; weights1=ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep1,#]&/@tuples1; weights2=ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep2,#]&/@tuples2; localWeights1=DeleteDuplicates[weights1]; compatibleWeights=Select[localWeights1,MemberQ[weights2,mu-#]&];\r\n fullRow=If[compatibleWeights==={},ConstantArray[0,dim[rep1] dim[rep2]],Total[Flatten@KroneckerProduct[ProjectiveSingleSiteSectorBra[rep1,#,coefficients[\"Site1\"]],ProjectiveSingleSiteSectorBra[rep2,mu-#,coefficients[\"Site2\"]]]&/@compatibleWeights]];\r\n support=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu]; FullSimplify[fullRow[[support]]]\r\n ];\r\nProjectiveGeneratingRestrictionCheck[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List]:=Module[{support,direct,generated,residual},support=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu]; direct=Flatten[K22C[rep1,rep2,Sequence@@ProjectiveXi,Sequence@@ProjectiveAlpha,0,0,p,q]][[support]]; generated=ProjectiveGeneratingKRow[rep1,rep2,mu,p,q]; residual=Together[direct-generated];<|\"Support\"->support,\"GeneratedRow\"->generated,\"DirectRow\"->direct,\"Residual\"->residual,\"Exact\"->ProjectiveSectorZeroQ[residual]|>];\r\nProjectiveKRow[rep1_,rep2_,support_List,p_,q_]:=Module[{mu,totalWeights},totalWeights=Flatten[Table[ProjectiveSiteWeights[rep1][[i]]+ProjectiveSiteWeights[rep2][[j]],{i,dim[rep1]},{j,dim[rep2]}],1]; mu=totalWeights[[First[support]]]; ProjectiveGeneratingKRow[rep1,rep2,mu,p,q]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[generatingRestriction11,generatingRestriction12,generatingRestrictionAllExact];\r\ngeneratingRestriction11=Association@Table[mu->ProjectiveGeneratingRestrictionCheck[{1,1,0,0},{1,1,0,0},mu],{mu,Keys@Association@tensorDecomp[{1,1,0,0},{1,1,0,0}]}];\r\ngeneratingRestriction12=Association@Table[mu->ProjectiveGeneratingRestrictionCheck[{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0},mu],{mu,Keys@Association@tensorDecomp[{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0}]}];\r\ngeneratingRestrictionAllExact=TrueQ[And@@Lookup[Join[Values[generatingRestriction11],Values[generatingRestriction12]],\"Exact\"]];\r\n<|\"SectorFirstEqualsDirectK22C\"->generatingRestrictionAllExact,\"s1p1Checks\"->Map[#[\"Exact\"]&,generatingRestriction11],\"s1p2Checks\"->Map[#[\"Exact\"]&,generatingRestriction12]|>",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
