n><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s1p2Checks</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[168]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{SectorFirstEqualsDirectK22C}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{s1p1Checks}\\to \\langle\\!\\lvert \\left\\{2,2,0,0\\right\\}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\left\\{2,1,1,0\\right\\}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\\\\n  &,\\text{s1p2Checks}\\to \\langle\\!\\lvert \\left\\{3,3,0,0\\right\\}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\left\\{3,2,1,0\\right\\}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\left\\{2,2,1,1\\right\\}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "09cbc7aa-89f8-4128-8d70-69e11ab21501"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Completeness of the independent sector monomials\r\n\r\nThe sector restriction and the `K(p,q)` specialization are different questions. The matrix below keeps every Cartan-compatible tensor-product monomial covector as an independent row. Full row rank means that the existing `CGGenOp` technology can reconstruct an arbitrary vector in that weight sector if all monomial overlaps are known.\r\n\r\nThis succeeds in every tested channel. In particular, `{2,2,1,1}` inside `6 x 20'` has sector dimension 7; its 8 nonzero compatible monomials have rank 7. The loss of one reconstruction equation occurs only after these independent monomials are collapsed onto Matteo's two-parameter `K(p,q)` specialization, whose overlap system has nullity 2 in that channel.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ProjectiveSectorMonomialMatrix,ProjectiveSectorSpanningCheck];\r\nProjectiveSectorMonomialMatrix[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List]:=Module[{tuples1,tuples2,pairs,support,rows},\r\n tuples1=ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep1[[1]]]; tuples2=ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep2[[1]]]; pairs=Select[Tuples[{tuples1,tuples2}],ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep1,#[[1]]]+ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep2,#[[2]]]===mu&]; support=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu];\r\n rows=(Flatten@KroneckerProduct[ProjectiveBraMonomial[rep1,#[[1]]],ProjectiveBraMonomial[rep2,#[[2]]][[All]]]&/@pairs); rows=#[[support]]&/@rows; Select[rows,!ProjectiveSectorZeroQ[#]&]\r\n ];\r\nProjectiveSectorSpanningCheck[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List]:=Module[{matrix=ProjectiveSectorMonomialMatrix[rep1,rep2,mu],sectorDimension},sectorDimension=Length@ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu];<|\"SectorDimension\"->sectorDimension,\"NonzeroCompatibleMonomials\"->Length[matrix],\"MonomialRank\"->If[matrix==={},0,MatrixRank[matrix]],\"CompleteSectorSpan\"->TrueQ[If[matrix==={},0,MatrixRank[matrix]]==sectorDimension]|>]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[sectorSpan11,sectorSpan12,sectorSpanAllExact];\r\nsectorSpan11=Association@Table[mu->ProjectiveSectorSpanningCheck[{1,1,0,0},{1,1,0,0},mu],{mu,Keys@Association@tensorDecomp[{1,1,0,0},{1,1,0,0}]}];\r\nsectorSpan12=Association@Table[mu->ProjectiveSectorSpanningCheck[{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0},mu],{mu,Keys@Association@tensorDecomp[{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0}]}];\r\nsectorSpanAllExact=TrueQ[And@@Lookup[Join[Values[sectorSpan11],Values[sectorSpan12]],\"CompleteSectorSpan\"]];\r\n<|\"AllIndependentSectorMonomialsSpan\"->sectorSpanAllExact,\"s1p1\"->sectorSpan11,\"s1p2\"->sectorSpan12|>",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
