  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## General untwisted-Q reconstruction of the highest-weight CG vector\r\n\r\n`Psi0FromUntwistedQs` takes the untwisted state and vacuum Q-functions as its primary input. It forms the leading untwisted determinant ratio, substitutes the universal effective determinant coordinates into the expanded `K22C` exponential, and solves the resulting homogeneous coefficient system. Because the requested output irrep is part of the input, the solver also imposes that irrep's quadratic `gl(4)` Casimir eigenvalue.\r\n\r\nThe report keeps the two rank statements separate. `DeterminantAloneCompletelyFixesVector` records whether the single expanded overlap has nullity one before the irrep constraint; `CompletelyFixed` records uniqueness after selecting the stated irrep. This distinction matters for `{2,2,1,1}` in `6 x 20'`, where `K22C` has one blind direction.\r\n\r\nThe returned full tensor-product vector is checked afterward against all four total Cartan generators and all three simple-root raising generators. `Psi0FromFastSolver` is only a convenience wrapper supplying the Q-functions with `BuildQs`; the independent highest-weight nullspace is used solely as a final certification, never as a reconstruction constraint.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ProjectiveVectorZeroQ,ProjectiveRawLeadingDataFromQs,ProjectiveQuadraticCasimirEigenvalue,ProjectiveTotalQuadraticCasimir,SolveProjectiveOverlapVectorDetailed,Psi0FromUntwistedQs,Psi0FromFastSolver];\r\nProjectiveVectorZeroQ[expression_]:=TrueQ[And@@(PossibleZeroQ/@Flatten[{expression}])];\r\nProjectiveRawLeadingDataFromQs[qState_List,qVacuum_List,rep1_List,rep2_List,kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[{qhl,statePieces,vacuumPieces,stateLeading,vacuumLeading,stateScalar,vacuumScalar},\r\n qhl=ProjectiveDualQ[projectiveDelta,kDet3,kDet4]; statePieces=ProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl,qState,rep1,rep2]; vacuumPieces=ProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl,qVacuum,rep1,rep2];\r\n stateLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[statePieces,projectiveDelta]; vacuumLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[vacuumPieces,projectiveDelta]; stateScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[stateLeading]; vacuumScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[vacuumLeading];\r\n <|\"NetOrder\"->stateScalar[\"Order\"]-vacuumScalar[\"Order\"],\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"->FullSimplify[stateScalar[\"Coefficient\"]/vacuumScalar[\"Coefficient\"]],\"StateLeading\"->stateLeading,\"VacuumLeading\"->vacuumLeading|>\r\n ];\r\nProjectiveQuadraticCasimirEigenvalue[mu_List]:=Sum[mu[[a]] (mu[[a]]+5-2 a),{a,1,4}];\r\nProjectiveTotalQuadraticCasimir[rep1_List,rep2_List]:=Module[{identity1=IdentityMatrix[dim[rep1]],identity2=IdentityMatrix[dim[rep2]],totalE},\r\n totalE[a_,b_]:=KroneckerProduct[EM[a,b,rep1],identity2]+KroneckerProduct[identity1,EM[a,b,rep2]]; Sum[totalE[a,b].totalE[b,a],{a,1,4},{b,1,4}]\r\n ];\r\nSolveProjectiveOverlapVectorDetailed[row_List,rhs_,variables_List,pivot_:Automatic,coefficientConstraints_:{}]:=Module[{coefficients,scale,unknowns,polynomial,expressions,overlapMatrix,overlapRank,overlapNullspace,constraintMatrix,matrix,rank,nullspace,solutionVector,pivotPosition,reconstructed,residual},\r\n coefficients=Array[Unique[\"cgCoefficient$\"]&,Length[row]]; scale=Unique[\"cgScale$\"]; unknowns=Join[coefficients,{scale}]; polynomial=Expand@Numerator@Together[row.coefficients-scale rhs]; expressions=Last/@CoefficientRules[polynomial,variables];\r\n overlapMatrix=Normal@Last@CoefficientArrays[expressions,unknowns]; overlapRank=MatrixRank[overlapMatrix]; overlapNullspace=NullSpace[overlapMatrix];\r\n constraintMatrix=If[coefficientConstraints==={},ConstantArray[0,{0,Length[unknowns]}],ArrayPad[Normal[coefficientConstraints],{{0,0},{0,1}}]]; matrix=Join[overlapMatrix,constraintMatrix]; rank=MatrixRank[matrix]; nullspace=NullSpace[matrix];\r\n If[Length[nullspace]=!=1,Return[<|\"OverlapEquationRank\"->overlapRank,\"OverlapNullity\"->Length[overlapNullspace],\"EquationRank\"->rank,\"Nullity\"->Length[nullspace],\"Exact\"->False|>]];\r\n solutionVector=First[nullspace]; pivotPosition=If[pivot===Automatic,First@Flatten@Position[Take[solutionVector,Length[row]],x_/;!TrueQ[PossibleZeroQ[x]],{1},Heads->False],pivot];\r\n If[PossibleZeroQ[solutionVector[[pivotPosition]]],Return[<|\"OverlapEquationRank\"->overlapRank,\"OverlapNullity\"->Length[overlapNullspace],\"EquationRank\"->rank,\"Nullity\"->Length[nullspace],\"Exact\"->False|>]];\r\n solutionVector=FullSimplify[solutionVector/solutionVector[[pivotPosition]]]; reconstructed=Take[solutionVector,Length[row]]; residual=FullSimplify[row.reconstructed-Last[solutionVector] rhs];\r\n <|\"Coefficients\"->reconstructed,\"Scale\"->Last[solutionVector],\"Residual\"->residual,\"OverlapEquationRank\"->overlapRank,\"OverlapNullity\"->Length[overlapNullspace],\"EquationRank\"->rank,\"UnknownCount\"->Length[unknowns],\"Nullity\"->Length[nullspace],\"Pivot\"->pivotPosition,\"Exact\"->ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[residual]|>\r\n ];\r\nPsi0FromUntwistedQs[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List,qState_List,qVacuum_List]:=Module[{support,raw,rhs,row,totalDimension,identity1,identity2,cartanOperators,raisingOperators,casimirOperator,casimirEigenvalue,irrepConstraints,reconstruction,psi,cartanResiduals,raisingResiduals,casimirResidual,highestWeightData,ratiosMatch,cartanExact,highestWeightExact,casimirExact,determinantAloneFixes,completelyFixed},\r\n support=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu]; raw=ProjectiveRawLeadingDataFromQs[qState,qVacuum,rep1,rep2,kDet3,kDet4]; rhs=FullSimplify[raw[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]/.{kDet3->EffectiveDetK3Projective[p,q],kDet4->EffectiveDetK4Projective[p,q]},Assumptions->{p>2,q>4}]; row=ProjectiveKRow[rep1,rep2,support,p,q];\r\n totalDimension=dim[rep1] dim[rep2]; identity1=IdentityMatrix[dim[rep1]]; identity2=IdentityMatrix[dim[rep2]]; cartanOperators=Table[KroneckerProduct[EM[a,a,rep1],identity2]+KroneckerProduct[identity1,EM[a,a,rep2]],{a,1,4}]; raisingOperators=Table[KroneckerProduct[EM[a,a+1,rep1],identity2]+KroneckerProduct[identity1,EM[a,a+1,rep2]],{a,1,3}];\r\n casimirOperator=ProjectiveTotalQuadraticCasimir[rep1,rep2]; casimirEigenvalue=ProjectiveQuadraticCasimirEigenvalue[mu]; irrepConstraints=(casimirOperator-casimirEigenvalue IdentityMatrix[totalDimension])[[All,support]];\r\n reconstruction=SolveProjectiveOverlapVectorDetailed[row,rhs,{p,q},Automatic,irrepConstraints]; psi=Normal@SparseArray[Thread[support->reconstruction[\"Coefficients\"]],totalDimension];\r\n cartanResiduals=Table[FullSimplify[(cartanOperators[[a]]-mu[[a]] IdentityMatrix[totalDimension]).psi],{a,1,4}]; raisingResiduals=FullSimplify[#.psi]&/@raisingOperators; casimirResidual=FullSimplify[(casimirOperator-casimirEigenvalue IdentityMatrix[totalDimension]).psi];\r\n highestWeightData=ProjectiveHighestWeightData[rep1,rep2,mu]; ratiosMatch=TrueQ[reconstruction[\"Coefficients\"]==highestWeightData[\"Ratios\"]]; cartanExact=ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[cartanResiduals]; highestWeightExact=ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[raisingResiduals]; casimirExact=ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[casimirResidual]; determinantAloneFixes=TrueQ[reconstruction[\"OverlapNullity\"]==1];\r\n completelyFixed=TrueQ[reconstruction[\"Exact\"]&&reconstruction[\"Nullity\"]==1&&highestWeightData[\"Exact\"]&&cartanExact&&highestWeightExact&&casimirExact&&ratiosMatch];\r\n <|\"Representation\"->mu,\"Support\"->support,\"UntwistedStateQs\"->qState,\"UntwistedVacuumQs\"->qVacuum,\"RawDeterminantData\"->raw,\"DeterminantRHS\"->rhs,\"ExpandedKRow\"->row,\"CGCoefficients\"->reconstruction[\"Coefficients\"],\"FullVector\"->psi,\"OverallScale\"->reconstruction[\"Scale\"],\"ReconstructionResidual\"->reconstruction[\"Residual\"],\"OverlapEquationRank\"->reconstruction[\"OverlapEquationRank\"],\"OverlapNullity\"->reconstruction[\"OverlapNullity\"],\"DeterminantAloneCompletelyFixesVector\"->determinantAloneFixes,\"ReconstructionEquationRank\"->reconstruction[\"EquationRank\"],\"ReconstructionUnknownCount\"->reconstruction[\"UnknownCount\"],\"ReconstructionNullity\"->reconstruction[\"Nullity\"],\"CasimirEigenvalue\"->casimirEigenvalue,\"CasimirResidual\"->casimirResidual,\"CasimirExact\"->casimirExact,\"CartanResiduals\"->cartanResiduals,\"CartanExact\"->cartanExact,\"RaisingResiduals\"->raisingResiduals,\"HighestWeightExact\"->highestWeightExact,\"IndependentHighestWeightRatios\"->highestWeightData[\"Ratios\"],\"HighestWeightNullity\"->If[KeyExistsQ[highestWeightData,\"Nullity\"],highestWeightData[\"Nullity\"],1],\"IndependentRatiosMatch\"->ratiosMatch,\"CompletelyFixed\"->completelyFixed|>\r\n ];\r\nPsi0FromFastSolver[s_Integer?Positive,p_Integer?Positive,mu_List]:=Module[{rep1={s,s,0,0},rep2={p,p,0,0}},Psi0FromUntwistedQs[rep1,rep2,mu,ProjectiveFastQPair[s,p,mu],ProjectiveFastQPair[s,p,rep1+rep2]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
