  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Complementary `SU(3)` two-site x `SU(2)` one-site determinant\r\n\r\nMatteo's `K22B` / `OrthogRen22B` is the complementary separation-of-variables determinant that was not used in the reconstruction above. Its first tensor factor is the one-site `SU(2)` block and its second factor is the two-site `SU(3)` block. The sector-first expansion below uses the same `CGGenOp` monomial machinery as `K22C`.\r\n\r\nFor unequal sites the useful equation is obtained after exchanging the two tensor factors. Both determinant identities refer to the same twisted eigenvector normalization, so their untwisting orders must be compared before taking a projective limit. In the exceptional `{2,2,1,1}` channel of `6 x 20'`, `K22C` has order `-4`, whereas swapped `K22B` has order `-2`. Relative to the common `K22C` normalization, the `K22B` determinant RHS therefore vanishes as `delta^2`; its expanded K-vector nevertheless gives a nontrivial homogeneous equation.\r\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\n  ProjectiveK22BCoefficients,ProjectiveGeneratingRowWithCoefficients,\n  ProjectiveGeneratingKRowB,ProjectiveSwappedGeneratingKRowB,\n  ProjectiveDirectSiteBra,ProjectiveDirectK22B,\n  UntwistedBSU2Det,UntwistedBSU2Norm,UntwistedBSU3Matrix,\n  UntwistedBSU3Norm,ProjectiveBIntegralPieces,\n  ProjectiveBFastRawLeadingData,SolveProjectiveOverlapPair\n];\n\nProjectiveK22BCoefficients[p_,q_]:=Module[\n {x1=ProjectiveXi[[1]],x2=ProjectiveXi[[2]],x3=ProjectiveXi[[3]],x4=ProjectiveXi[[4]],\n  a13=ProjectiveAlpha[[1]],a14=ProjectiveAlpha[[2]],a23=ProjectiveAlpha[[3]],a24},\n a24=a14 a23 (x2-x3) (x1-x4)/(a13 (x1-x3) (x2-x4));\n <|\n  \"Site1\"->{\n    a13 (p-x3) (q-x2-x3)/((p-x1) (q-x1-x2)),\n    a14 (p-x4) (q-x2-x4)/((p-x1) (q-x1-x2)),\n    a23 (p-x3) (q-x1-x3)/((p-x2) (q-x1-x2)),\n    a24 (p-x4) (q-x1-x4)/((p-x2) (q-x1-x2))},\n  \"Site2\"->{\n    a13 (p-x3)/(p-x1),a14 (p-x4)/(p-x1),\n    a23 (p-x3)/(p-x2),a24 (p-x4)/(p-x2)}\n |>\n];\n\nProjectiveGeneratingRowWithCoefficients[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List,coefficients_Association]:=Module[\n {tuples1,tuples2,weights1,weights2,compatibleWeights,fullRow,support},\n tuples1=ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep1[[1]]];\n tuples2=ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep2[[1]]];\n weights1=ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep1,#]&/@tuples1;\n weights2=ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep2,#]&/@tuples2;\n compatibleWeights=Select[DeleteDuplicates[weights1],MemberQ[weights2,mu-#]&];\n fullRow=If[compatibleWeights==={},ConstantArray[0,dim[rep1] dim[rep2]],\n   Total[Flatten@KroneckerProduct[\n      ProjectiveSingleSiteSectorBra[rep1,#,coefficients[\"Site1\"]],\n      ProjectiveSingleSiteSectorBra[rep2,mu-#,coefficients[\"Site2\"]]]&/@compatibleWeights]];\n support=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu];\n FullSimplify[fullRow[[support]]]\n];\n\nProjectiveGeneratingKRowB[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List,p_,q_]:=\n ProjectiveGeneratingRowWithCoefficients[rep1,rep2,mu,ProjectiveK22BCoefficients[p,q]];\n\nProjectiveDirectSiteBra[rep_List,coefficients_List]:=Fold[\n Dot,Flatten[UPL1[rep]],MapThread[MatrixExp[#1 EM@@Join[#2,{rep}]]&,\n   {coefficients,{{1,3},{1,4},{2,3},{2,4}}}]\n];\n\nProjectiveDirectK22B[rep1_List,rep2_List,p_,q_]:=Module[{coefficients=ProjectiveK22BCoefficients[p,q]},\n Flatten@KroneckerProduct[\n   ProjectiveDirectSiteBra[rep1,coefficients[\"Site1\"]],\n   ProjectiveDirectSiteBra[rep2,coefficients[\"Site2\"]]]\n];\n\nProjectiveSwappedGeneratingKRowB[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List,p_,q_]:=Module[\n {d1=dim[rep1],d2=dim[rep2],support,supportSwapped,rowSwapped,swapIndex},\n support=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep1,rep2,mu];\n supportSwapped=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[rep2,rep1,mu];\n rowSwapped=ProjectiveGeneratingKRowB[rep2,rep1,mu,p,q];\n swapIndex[index_]:=With[{i=Quotient[index-1,d2]+1,j=Mod[index-1,d2]+1},(j-1)d1+i];\n FullSimplify[(rowSwapped[[First@FirstPosition[supportSwapped,swapIndex[#]]]])&/@support]\n];\n\nUntwistedBSU2Det[qhl_,qr_,rep1_List]:=Module[{zz=Global`z,wr},\n wr=Wronskian[{qr[[1]],qr[[2]]},zz];\n 2 Pi I Residue[qhl[[4]] wr/zz^(rep1[[1]]-rep1[[4]]+1),{zz,0}]\n];\n\nUntwistedBSU2Norm[qhl_,qr_]:=Module[{zz=Global`z,wr},\n wr=Wronskian[{qr[[1]],qr[[2]]},zz];\n (qhl[[4]]/.zz->0) (wr/.zz->0)\n];\n\nUntwistedBSU3Matrix[qhl_,qr_,rep1_List,rep2_List]:=Module[\n {zz=Global`z,weight,entry},\n weight=1/(zz^(rep1[[1]]-rep1[[3]]) (zz-1)^(rep2[[1]]-rep2[[3]]));\n entry[r_,site_,1]:=2 Pi I Residue[qhl[[3]] D[qr[[r]],zz] weight/zz,{zz,site}];\n entry[r_,site_,2]:=2 Pi I Residue[qhl[[3]] qr[[r]] weight/zz^2,{zz,site}];\n entry[r_,site_,3]:=2 Pi I Residue[qhl[[3]] D[qr[[r]],zz] weight/(zz-1),{zz,site}];\n entry[r_,site_,4]:=2 Pi I Residue[qhl[[3]] qr[[r]] weight/(zz-1)^2,{zz,site}];\n Flatten[Table[Table[entry[r,site,column],{column,1,4}],{site,{0,1}},{r,1,2}],1]\n];\n\nUntwistedBSU3Norm[qhl_,qr_]:=Module[{zz=Global`z,wr},\n wr=Wronskian[{qr[[1]],qr[[2]]},zz];\n Product[(qhl[[3]]/.zz->site) (D[qhl[[3]],zz]/.zz->site) (wr/.zz->site),{site,{0,1}}]\n];\n\nProjectiveBIntegralPieces[qhl_,qr_,rep1_List,rep2_List]:=Module[\n {matrix3=UntwistedBSU3Matrix[qhl,qr,rep1,rep2]},\n <|\"SU2Det\"->UntwistedBSU2Det[qhl,qr,rep1],\"SU2Norm\"->UntwistedBSU2Norm[qhl,qr],\n   \"SU3Matrix\"->matrix3,\"SU3Det\"->Det[matrix3],\"SU3Norm\"->UntwistedBSU3Norm[qhl,qr]|>\n];\n\nProjectiveBFastRawLeadingData[S1_,S2_,mu_List,rep1_List,rep2_List,kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[\n {qhl,statePieces,vacuumPieces,stateLeading,vacuumLeading,stateScalar,vacuumScalar},\n qhl=ProjectiveDualQ[projectiveDelta,kDet3,kDet4];\n statePieces=ProjectiveBIntegralPieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[S1,S2,mu],rep1,rep2];\n vacuumPieces=ProjectiveBIntegralPieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[S1,S2,rep1+rep2],rep1,rep2];\n stateLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[statePieces,projectiveDelta];\n vacuumLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[vacuumPieces,projectiveDelta];\n stateScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[stateLeading];\n vacuumScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[vacuumLeading];\n <|\"NetOrder\"->stateScalar[\"Order\"]-vacuumScalar[\"Order\"],\n   \"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"->FullSimplify[stateScalar[\"Coefficient\"]/vacuumScalar[\"Coefficient\"]],\n   \"StateLeading\"->stateLeading,\"VacuumLeading\"->vacuumLeading|>\n];\n\nSolveProjectiveOverlapPair[rowC_List,rhsC_,rowB_List,rhsB_,variables_List,pivot_:Automatic]:=Module[\n {coefficients,scale,unknowns,expressionsC,expressionsB,matrixC,matrixB,matrix,\n  nullspace,solution,pivotPosition,residualC,residualB},\n coefficients=Array[Unique[\"cgCoefficient$\"]&,Length[rowC]];\n scale=Unique[\"cgScale$\"]; unknowns=Join[coefficients,{scale}];\n expressionsC=Last/@CoefficientRules[Expand@Numerator@Together[rowC.coefficients-scale rhsC],variables];\n expressionsB=Last/@CoefficientRules[Expand@Numerator@Together[rowB.coefficients-scale rhsB],variables];\n matrixC=Normal@Last@CoefficientArrays[expressionsC,unknowns];\n matrixB=Normal@Last@CoefficientArrays[expressionsB,unknowns];\n matrix=Join[matrixC,matrixB]; nullspace=NullSpace[matrix];\n If[Length[nullspace]=!=1,Return[<|\"CEquationRank\"->MatrixRank[matrixC],\"BEquationRank\"->MatrixRank[matrixB],\n   \"CombinedRank\"->MatrixRank[matrix],\"Nullity\"->Length[nullspace],\"Exact\"->False|>]];\n solution=First[nullspace];\n pivotPosition=If[pivot===Automatic,First@Flatten@Position[Take[solution,Length[rowC]],x_/;!TrueQ[PossibleZeroQ[x]],{1},Heads->False],pivot];\n solution=FullSimplify[solution/solution[[pivotPosition]]];\n residualC=FullSimplify[rowC.Take[solution,Length[rowC]]-Last[solution] rhsC];\n residualB=FullSimplify[rowB.Take[solution,Length[rowB]]-Last[solution] rhsB];\n <|\"Coefficients\"->Take[solution,Length[rowC]],\"Scale\"->Last[solution],\n   \"CEquationRank\"->MatrixRank[matrixC],\"BEquationRank\"->MatrixRank[matrixB],\n   \"CombinedRank\"->MatrixRank[matrix],\"UnknownCount\"->Length[unknowns],\"Nullity\"->Length[nullspace],\n   \"CResidual\"->residualC,\"BResidual\"->residualB,\n   \"Exact\"->TrueQ[ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[residualC]&&ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[residualB]]|>\n];\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\n complementaryBRep1,complementaryBRep2,complementaryBMu,complementaryBSupport,\n complementaryBCRow,complementaryBBRow,complementaryBCRaw,complementaryBBRaw,\n complementaryBCRHS,complementaryBReconstruction,complementaryBHWS,\n complementaryBDirectCheck,complementaryBAllExact\n];\n\ncomplementaryBRep1={1,1,0,0};\ncomplementaryBRep2={2,2,0,0};\ncomplementaryBMu={2,2,1,1};\ncomplementaryBSupport=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[complementaryBRep1,complementaryBRep2,complementaryBMu];\ncomplementaryBCRow=ProjectiveGeneratingKRow[complementaryBRep1,complementaryBRep2,complementaryBMu,p,q];\ncomplementaryBBRow=ProjectiveSwappedGeneratingKRowB[complementaryBRep1,complementaryBRep2,complementaryBMu,p,q];\ncomplementaryBCRaw=psi0Tests12[\"Results\"][complementaryBMu][\"RawDeterminantData\"];\ncomplementaryBBRaw=ProjectiveBFastRawLeadingData[2,1,complementaryBMu,complementaryBRep2,complementaryBRep1,2,3];\ncomplementaryBCRHS=FullSimplify[complementaryBCRaw[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]/.{\n  kDet3->EffectiveDetK3Projective[p,q],kDet4->EffectiveDetK4Projective[p,q]},Assumptions->{p>2,q>4}];\n\n(* B is two powers less singular, hence its RHS is zero in the common C-normalized limit. *)\ncomplementaryBReconstruction=SolveProjectiveOverlapPair[\n complementaryBCRow,complementaryBCRHS,complementaryBBRow,0,{p,q}];\ncomplementaryBHWS=ProjectiveHighestWeightData[complementaryBRep1,complementaryBRep2,complementaryBMu];\n\ncomplementaryBDirectCheck=Module[{supportSwapped,direct,generated},\n supportSwapped=ProjectiveWeightSectorIndices[complementaryBRep2,complementaryBRep1,complementaryBMu];\n direct=ProjectiveDirectK22B[complementaryBRep2,complementaryBRep1,p,q][[supportSwapped]];\n generated=ProjectiveGeneratingKRowB[complementaryBRep2,complementaryBRep1,complementaryBMu,p,q];\n ProjectiveSectorZeroQ[Together[direct-generated]]\n];\n\ncomplementaryBAllExact=TrueQ[\n complementaryBDirectCheck&&\n complementaryBCRaw[\"NetOrder\"]==-4&&\n complementaryBBRaw[\"NetOrder\"]==-2&&\n complementaryBReconstruction[\"Nullity\"]==1&&\n complementaryBReconstruction[\"Exact\"]&&\n complementaryBReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"]==complementaryBHWS[\"Ratios\"]&&\n ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[complementaryBBRow.complementaryBHWS[\"Ratios\"]]\n];\n\n<|\n \"MatteoK22BIdentified\"->True,\n \"SectorFirstBEqualsDirectK22B\"->complementaryBDirectCheck,\n \"CDeterminantOrder\"->complementaryBCRaw[\"NetOrder\"],\n \"SwappedBDeterminantOrder\"->complementaryBBRaw[\"NetOrder\"],\n \"RelativeBOrder\"->complementaryBBRaw[\"NetOrder\"]-complementaryBCRaw[\"NetOrder\"],\n \"CommonNormalizationBRHS\"->0,\n \"COnlyNullity\"->psi0Tests12[\"Results\"][complementaryBMu][\"OverlapNullity\"],\n \"CEquationRank\"->complementaryBReconstruction[\"CEquationRank\"],\n \"SwappedBEquationRank\"->complementaryBReconstruction[\"BEquationRank\"],\n \"CombinedRank\"->complementaryBReconstruction[\"CombinedRank\"],\n \"CombinedNullity\"->complementaryBReconstruction[\"Nullity\"],\n \"ReconstructedCGCoefficients\"->complementaryBReconstruction[\"Coefficients\"],\n \"IndependentHighestWeightRatios\"->complementaryBHWS[\"Ratios\"],\n \"BAnnihilatesHighestWeightVector\"->ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[complementaryBBRow.complementaryBHWS[\"Ratios\"]],\n \"ComplementaryDeterminantsFixVectorWithoutCasimir\"->complementaryBAllExact\n|>\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"765692\" data-output-id=\"69\" data-out-n=\"233\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"239\" data-sub-start=\"40\" data-sub-end=\"56\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[233]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"39\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:14.1001em;vertical-align:-6.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.3em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.49em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:2.99em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\">