lass=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.49em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BAnnihilatesHighestWeightVector</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.99em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ComplementaryDeterminantsFixVectorWithoutCasimir</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[233]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{MatteoK22BIdentified}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{SectorFirstBEqualsDirectK22B}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{CDeterminantOrder}\\to -4,\\text{SwappedBDeterminantOrder}\\to -2 \\\\\n  &,\\text{RelativeBOrder}\\to 2,\\text{CommonNormalizationBRHS}\\to 0,\\text{COnlyNullity}\\to 2 \\\\\n  &,\\text{CEquationRank}\\to 6,\\text{SwappedBEquationRank}\\to 3,\\text{CombinedRank}\\to 7 \\\\\n  &,\\text{CombinedNullity}\\to 1,\\text{ReconstructedCGCoefficients}\\to \\left\\{0,1,-3,\\frac{9}{2},3,-\\frac{9}{2},\\frac{9}{2}\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{IndependentHighestWeightRatios}\\to \\left\\{0,1,-3,\\frac{9}{2},3,-\\frac{9}{2},\\frac{9}{2}\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{BAnnihilatesHighestWeightVector}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{ComplementaryDeterminantsFixVectorWithoutCasimir}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c1206d9f-6fe7-4e09-a151-650aa91db3a0"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Matteo's simpler `SU(2)` two-site x `SU(2)` one-site candidate\n\nThe older source also contains a much cheaper candidate made from `SU2OrthogRen` at two sites times `SU2OrthogRen1` at one site. It appears under `OrthogRen22` as Matteo's commented �?oMy guess�?�, not as one of the subsequently verified `K22B`/`K22C` identities. In the same source, coefficient matching for its proposed general `K22` is reported to give only the trivial solution. Thus the Q-determinant can be evaluated, but its universal raising-operator K-vector is still missing.\n\nThe cell below ports the candidate directly to untwisted fast Q-functions. It is computationally simpler and is not merely proportional to `K22C`: for `{2,2,1,1}` in `6 x 20'` its leading ratio is `800/(3 kDet3 kDet4^2)`, while `K22C` gives `-2000/(3 kDet3^2 kDet4^2)`. It may therefore be useful if a nontrivial K-vector identification can be derived, but it cannot yet replace the verified swapped-`K22B` constraint.\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\n UntwistedSimpleSU2OneSiteDet,UntwistedSimpleSU2OneSiteNorm,\n ProjectiveSimple22Pieces,ProjectiveSimple22RawLeadingData,\n simple22ExceptionalOriginal,simple22ExceptionalSwapped,simple22ExceptionalSymbolic,\n simple22CStateFactor,simple22SimpleStateFactor,simple22FactorComparison\n];\n\nUntwistedSimpleSU2OneSiteDet[qhlEntry_,qr_,rep1_List]:=Module[{zz=Global`z,wr,shift},\n wr=Wronskian[{qr[[1]],qr[[2]]},zz];\n shift=rep1[[1]]-rep1[[2]];\n 2 Pi I Residue[qhlEntry wr/zz^(shift+rep1[[1]]-rep1[[4]]+1),{zz,0}]\n];\n\nUntwistedSimpleSU2OneSiteNorm[qhlEntry_,qr_,rep1_List]:=Module[{zz=Global`z,wr,shift},\n wr=Wronskian[{qr[[1]],qr[[2]]},zz];\n shift=rep1[[1]]-rep1[[2]];\n (qhlEntry/.zz->0) ((wr/zz^shift)/.zz->0)\n];\n\nProjectiveSimple22Pieces[qhl_,qr_,rep1_List,rep2_List]:=Module[\n {matrix2=UntwistedSU2IntegralMatrix[qhl,qr,rep1,rep2]},\n <|\"SU2Det\"->Det[matrix2],\"SU2Norm\"->UntwistedSU2Norm[qhl,qr],\n   \"SU3Det\"->UntwistedSimpleSU2OneSiteDet[qhl[[3]],qr,rep1],\n   \"SU3Norm\"->UntwistedSimpleSU2OneSiteNorm[qhl[[3]],qr,rep1]|>\n];\n\nProjectiveSimple22RawLeadingData[S1_,S2_,mu_List,rep1_List,rep2_List,kDet3_,kDet4_]:=Module[\n {qhl,statePieces,vacuumPieces,stateLeading,vacuumLeading,stateScalar,vacuumScalar},\n qhl=ProjectiveDualQ[projectiveDelta,kDet3,kDet4];\n statePieces=ProjectiveSimple22Pieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[S1,S2,mu],rep1,rep2];\n vacuumPieces=ProjectiveSimple22Pieces[qhl,ProjectiveFastQPair[S1,S2,rep1+rep2],rep1,rep2];\n stateLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[statePieces,projectiveDelta];\n vacuumLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[vacuumPieces,projectiveDelta];\n stateScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[stateLeading]; vacuumScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[vacuumLeading];\n <|\"NetOrder\"->stateScalar[\"Order\"]-vacuumScalar[\"Order\"],\n   \"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"->FullSimplify[stateScalar[\"Coefficient\"]/vacuumScalar[\"Coefficient\"]],\n   \"StateLeading\"->stateLeading,\"VacuumLeading\"->vacuumLeading|>\n];\n\nsimple22ExceptionalOriginal=ProjectiveSimple22RawLeadingData[\n 1,2,{2,2,1,1},{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0},2,3];\nsimple22ExceptionalSwapped=ProjectiveSimple22RawLeadingData[\n 2,1,{2,2,1,1},{2,2,0,0},{1,1,0,0},2,3];\nsimple22ExceptionalSymbolic=ProjectiveSimple22RawLeadingData[\n 1,2,{2,2,1,1},{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0},kDet3,kDet4];\n\nsimple22FactorComparison=Module[{qhl,qr,cPieces,sPieces,cLeading,sLeading,cScalar,sScalar},\n qhl=ProjectiveDualQ[projectiveDelta,2,3];\n qr=ProjectiveFastQPair[1,2,{2,2,1,1}];\n cPieces=ProjectiveIntegralPieces[qhl,qr,{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0}];\n sPieces=ProjectiveSimple22Pieces[qhl,qr,{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0}];\n cLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[cPieces,projectiveDelta];\n sLeading=UntwistedLeadingPieces[sPieces,projectiveDelta];\n cScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[cLeading]; sScalar=UntwistedScalarLeading[sLeading];\n <|\"CStateOrder\"->cScalar[\"Order\"],\"SimpleStateOrder\"->sScalar[\"Order\"],\n   \"CStateCoefficient\"->cScalar[\"Coefficient\"],\"SimpleStateCoefficient\"->sScalar[\"Coefficient\"],\n   \"CoefficientRatio\"->FullSimplify[sScalar[\"Coefficient\"]/cScalar[\"Coefficient\"]]|>\n];\n\n<|\n \"MatteoSourceStatus\"->\"Commented guess; K22 coefficient solve reported only the trivial solution\",\n \"OriginalOrder\"->simple22ExceptionalOriginal[\"NetOrder\"],\n \"OriginalLeadingRatio\"->simple22ExceptionalOriginal[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"],\n \"OriginalSymbolicLeadingRatio\"->simple22ExceptionalSymbolic[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"],\n \"RatioToK22C\"->FullSimplify[simple22ExceptionalSymbolic[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]/\n   psi0Tests12[\"Results\"][{2,2,1,1}][\"RawDeterminantData\"][\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"]],\n \"SwappedOrder\"->simple22ExceptionalSwapped[\"NetOrder\"],\n \"SwappedLeadingRatio\"->simple22ExceptionalSwapped[\"LeadingCoefficientRatio\"],\n \"ComparisonWithK22CStateFactor\"->simple22FactorComparison\n|>\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"765692\" data-output-id=\"70\" data-out-n=\"242\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"240\" data-sub-start=\"57\" data-sub-end=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[242]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:11.1457em;vertical-align:-5.3229em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.8229em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.3277em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.8277em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.8463em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5389em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.7128em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.3229em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.8229em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.3277em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MatteoSourceStatus</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.8277em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Commented guess; K22 coefficient solve reported only the trivial solution</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.8463em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OriginalOrder</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OriginalLeadingRatio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SwappedOrder</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5389em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SwappedLeadingRatio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">81</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ComparisonWithK22CStateFactor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.7128em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CStateOrder</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SimpleStateOrder</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CStateCoefficient</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3449em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SimpleStateCoefficient</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CoefficientRatio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3449em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.3229em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[242]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{MatteoSourceStatus} \\\\\n  &\\to \\text{Commented guess; K22 coefficient solve reported only the trivial solution} \\\\\n  &,\\text{OriginalOrder}\\to -3,\\text{OriginalLeadingRatio}\\to \\frac{400}{27},\\text{SwappedOrder}\\to -4 \\\\\n  &,\\text{SwappedLeadingRatio}\\to -\\frac{500}{81},\\text{ComparisonWithK22CStateFactor}\\to \\\\\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{CStateOrder}\\to 1,\\text{SimpleStateOrder}\\to 1,\\text{CStateCoefficient}\\to \\\\\n  &-8000\\,\\pi ^4,\\text{SimpleStateCoefficient}\\to 3200\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,\\pi ^3,\\text{CoefficientRatio}\\to -\\frac{2\\,\\mathrm{i}}{5\\,\\pi }\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7a6ec932-d14f-423f-a563-9788e2556c76"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## First-site monomial overlaps\n\nDefine\n\n`<n13,n14,n23,n24,0,0,0,0| = <HWS| E13^n13 E14^n14 E23^n23 E24^n24`,\n\nwith every generator acting on the first tensor factor and the second factor left in its highest-weight bra. The four cross-block generators commute, so no ordering convention is required. The routines below construct these covectors directly, evaluate all of their overlaps with a reconstructed `Psi0`, and retain the Cartan-compatible tuples for a requested output weight.\n\nThese overlaps are not assumed as reconstruction constraints. Rather, the determinant reconstruction supplies `Psi0`; the overlap table is then exact. When the highest-weight space of the requested irrep is one-dimensional, any one nonzero entry fixes its overall scale and hence the complete highest-weight vector.\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\n ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialBra,ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialOverlap,\n ProjectiveFirstSiteCompatibleTuples,ProjectiveAllFirstSiteOverlaps,\n ProjectiveFirstSiteGeneratingOverlap,ProjectiveFirstSiteExtractOverlap,\n ProjectiveFirstSiteDirectExponentialOverlap,ProjectivePaulRelativeCoordinates,\n ProjectiveFirstSiteOverlapReport,firstSiteOverlapTests11,firstSiteOverlapTests12,\n firstSiteGeneratingChecks11,firstSiteGeneratingChecks12,\n firstSiteOverlapAllExact,firstSiteGeneratingAllExact,firstSitePaulCoordinateRank\n];\n\nProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialBra[rep1_List,rep2_List,n_List]:=\n Flatten@KroneckerProduct[ProjectiveBraMonomial[rep1,n],Flatten[UPL1[rep2]]];\n\nProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialOverlap[psi_List,rep1_List,rep2_List,n_List]:=\n FullSimplify[ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialBra[rep1,rep2,n].psi];\n\nProjectiveFirstSiteCompatibleTuples[rep1_List,rep2_List,mu_List]:=Select[\n ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep1[[1]]],\n ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep1,#]+rep2===mu&&\n   !ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialBra[rep1,rep2,#]]&\n];\n\nProjectiveAllFirstSiteOverlaps[psi_List,rep1_List,rep2_List]:=\n Association@Table[\n  n->ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialOverlap[psi,rep1,rep2,n],\n  {n,Select[ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[rep1[[1]]],\n    !ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialBra[rep1,rep2,#]]&]}];\n\nProjectiveFirstSiteGeneratingOverlap[psi_List,rep1_List,rep2_List,u_List]:=Total[\n KeyValueMap[#2 (Times@@MapThread[Power,{u,#1}])/(Times@@(Factorial/@#1))&,\n  ProjectiveAllFirstSiteOverlaps[psi,rep1,rep2]]];\n\nProjectiveFirstSiteExtractOverlap[generatingPolynomial_,u_List,n_List]:=\n Times@@(Factorial/@n) Fold[Coefficient[#1,#2[[1]],#2[[2]]]&,generatingPolynomial,Transpose[{u,n}]];\n\nProjectiveFirstSiteDirectExponentialOverlap[psi_List,rep1_List,rep2_List,u_List]:=\n FullSimplify[Flatten@KroneckerProduct[\n   ProjectiveDirectSiteBra[rep1,u],Flatten[UPL1[rep2]]].psi];\n\nProjectivePaulRelativeCoordinates[alphas_List,p_,q_]:=Block[{ProjectiveAlpha=alphas},\n With[{coefficients=ProjectiveK22CCoefficients[p,q]},\n  FullSimplify[coefficients[\"Site1\"]-coefficients[\"Site2\"]]]];\n\nProjectiveFirstSiteOverlapReport[result_Association,rep1_List,rep2_List]:=Module[\n {mu=result[\"Representation\"],psi=result[\"FullVector\"],tuples,compatibleOverlaps,allOverlaps,\n  nonzeroCompatible,highestWeightUnique,fixesScale},\n tuples=ProjectiveFirstSiteCompatibleTuples[rep1,rep2,mu];\n compatibleOverlaps=Association@Table[n->ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialOverlap[psi,rep1,rep2,n],{n,tuples}];\n allOverlaps=ProjectiveAllFirstSiteOverlaps[psi,rep1,rep2];\n nonzeroCompatible=Select[compatibleOverlaps,!TrueQ[PossibleZeroQ[#]]&];\n highestWeightUnique=TrueQ[result[\"HighestWeightNullity\"]==1];\n fixesScale=TrueQ[highestWeightUnique&&Length[nonzeroCompatible]>0];\n <|\"Representation\"->mu,\"CompatibleTuples\"->tuples,\n   \"CompatibleOverlaps\"->compatibleOverlaps,\"AllFirstSiteOverlaps\"->allOverlaps,\n   \"NonzeroCompatibleOverlapCount\"->Length[nonzeroCompatible],\n   \"HighestWeightSpaceUnique\"->highestWeightUnique,\n   \"FixesHighestWeightVectorUpToChosenNormalization\"->fixesScale|>\n];\n\nfirstSiteOverlapTests11=Association@KeyValueMap[\n (#1->ProjectiveFirstSiteOverlapReport[#2,{1,1,0,0},{1,1,0,0}])&,\n psi0Tests11[\"Results\"]];\nfirstSiteOverlapTests12=Association@KeyValueMap[\n (#1->ProjectiveFirstSiteOverlapReport[#2,{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0}])&,\n psi0Tests12[\"Results\"]];\nfirstSiteGeneratingChecks11=Association@KeyValueMap[(#1->ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[\n ProjectiveFirstSiteGeneratingOverlap[#2[\"FullVector\"],{1,1,0,0},{1,1,0,0},{u13,u14,u23,u24}]-\n ProjectiveFirstSiteDirectExponentialOverlap[#2[\"FullVector\"],{1,1,0,0},{1,1,0,0},{u13,u14,u23,u24}]])&,\n psi0Tests11[\"Results\"]];\nfirstSiteGeneratingChecks12=Association@KeyValueMap[(#1->ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[\n ProjectiveFirstSiteGeneratingOverlap[#2[\"FullVector\"],{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0},{u13,u14,u23,u24}]-\n ProjectiveFirstSiteDirectExponentialOverlap[#2[\"FullVector\"],{1,1,0,0},{2,2,0,0},{u13,u14,u23,u24}]])&,\n psi0Tests12[\"Results\"]];\nfirstSiteOverlapAllExact=TrueQ[And@@Lookup[\n Join[Values[firstSiteOverlapTests11],Values[firstSiteOverlapTests12]],\n \"FixesHighestWeightVectorUpToChosenNormalization\"]];\nfirstSiteGeneratingAllExact=TrueQ[And@@Join[Values[firstSiteGeneratingChecks11],Values[firstSiteGeneratingChecks12]]];\nfirstSitePaulCoordinateRank=MatrixRank[Table[\n D[ProjectivePaulRelativeCoordinates[{aa,bb,cc},pp,qq],variable],\n {variable,{aa,bb,cc,qq}}]/.{aa->2,bb->3,cc->5,pp->11,qq->13}];\n\n<|\n \"Definition\"->HoldForm[bra[n13,n14,n23,n24,0,0,0,0]==\n   braHWS.E13^n13.E14^n14.E23^n23.E24^n24],\n \"s1p1\"->Map[\n   <|\"CompatibleOverlaps\"->#[\"CompatibleOverlaps\"],\n     \"FixesHWS\"->#[\"FixesHighestWeightVectorUpToChosenNormalization\"]|>&,\n   firstSiteOverlapTests11],\n \"s1p2\"->Map[\n   <|\"CompatibleOverlaps\"->#[\"CompatibleOverlaps\"],\n     \"FixesHWS\"->#[\"FixesHighestWeightVectorUpToChosenNormalization\"]|>&,\n   firstSiteOverlapTests12],\n \"GeneratingPolynomialEqualsDirectExponentialAllSix\"->firstSiteGeneratingAllExact,\n \"PaulFrameIndependentCoordinateRank\"->firstSitePaulCoordinateRank,\n \"AllSixChannelsFixedByFirstSiteOverlapsAndHighestWeightUniqueness\"->firstSiteOverlapAllExact\n|>\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"765692\" data-output-id=\"71\" data-out-n=\"252\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"243\" data-sub-start=\"51\" data-sub-end=\"63\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[252]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:11.1242em;vertical-align:-5.3121em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.8121em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.4221em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.898em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.788em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6979em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.5879em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.5021em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.3121em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.8121em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.4221em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Definition</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">bra</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">23</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.898em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3