e\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FixesHighestWeightVectorUpToChosenNormalization</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FixesHighestWeightVectorUpToChosenNormalization</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.5021em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AllSixChannelsFixedByFirstSiteOverlapsAndHighestWeightUniqueness</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.3121em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[252]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{Definition}\\to \\mathrm{bra}\\left(n13,n14,n23,n24,0,0,0,0\\right)= \\\\\n  &=\\mathrm{braHWS}.\\,E13^{n13}.\\,E14^{n14}.\\,E23^{n23}.\\,E24^{n24},\\text{s1p1}\\to \\\\\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{CompatibleOverlaps}\\to \\left(\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\}\\to \\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{Representation}\\to \\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\},\\text{CompatibleTuples}\\to \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix},\\text{CompatibleOverlaps}\\to \\langle\\!\\lvert \\left\\{0,1,1,0\\right\\}\\to -4,\\left\\{1,0,0,1\\right\\}\\to 4\\rvert\\!\\rangle ,\\text{AllFirstSiteOverlaps}\\to \\langle\\!\\lvert \\left\\{0,0,0,0\\right\\}\\to 0,\\left\\{0,0,0,1\\right\\}\\to 0,\\left\\{0,0,1,0\\right\\}\\to 0,\\left\\{0,1,0,0\\right\\}\\to 0,\\left\\{1,0,0,0\\right\\}\\to 0,\\left\\{0,1,1,0\\right\\}\\to -4,\\left\\{1,0,0,1\\right\\}\\to 4\\rvert\\!\\rangle ,\\text{NonzeroCompatibleOverlapCount}\\to 2,\\text{HighestWeightSpaceUnique}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{FixesHighestWeightVectorUpToChosenNormalization}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\right)\\left(\\text{CompatibleOverlaps}\\right),\\text{FixesHWS}\\to \\left(\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\}\\to \\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{Representation}\\to \\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\},\\text{CompatibleTuples}\\to \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1 & 1 & 0\\\\1 &… [latex truncated: 3702 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
