     "id": "e59be430-01cb-4895-b7d8-bffcc85b1406"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Public API: first-site HWS overlaps from `(s,p,mu)`\n\n`FirstSiteHWSOverlaps[s,p,mu]` is the minimal interface for the multiplicity-one problem. The input representations are `{s,s,0,0}` and `{p,p,0,0}`. The function verifies that `mu` occurs in their tensor product and that its highest-weight nullspace is one-dimensional, fixes the projective tensor-basis normalization used throughout this workbook, and returns every first-site monomial overlap.\n\n`AllMonomialOverlaps` includes zero overlaps. `WeightCompatibleOverlaps` removes monomials forbidden by Cartan weight. `NonzeroWeightCompatibleOverlaps` contains the data that fix the HWS scale. `ProjectiveOverlapRatios` divides them by the first nonzero overlap, which is the normalization-independent CG information.\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[FirstSiteHWSOverlaps,FirstSiteHWSOverlapSuite,firstSiteHWSAPITests];\n\nFirstSiteHWSOverlaps[s_Integer?Positive,p_Integer?Positive,mu_List]:=Module[\n {rep1={s,s,0,0},rep2={p,p,0,0},decomposition,multiplicity,hws,totalDimension,psi,\n  tuples,allOverlaps,compatibleTuples,compatibleOverlaps,nonzeroOverlaps,\n  normalizationTuple,normalizationValue,projectiveRatios,generatingPolynomial},\n\n decomposition=Association@tensorDecomp[rep1,rep2];\n If[!KeyExistsQ[decomposition,mu],Return[Failure[\"IrrepNotInProduct\",\n   <|\"InputRepresentations\"->{rep1,rep2},\"RequestedRepresentation\"->mu,\n     \"AvailableRepresentations\"->Keys[decomposition]|>]]];\n multiplicity=decomposition[mu];\n hws=ProjectiveHighestWeightData[rep1,rep2,mu];\n If[!TrueQ[multiplicity==1&&hws[\"Exact\"]],Return[Failure[\"HighestWeightSpaceNotOneDimensional\",\n   <|\"InputRepresentations\"->{rep1,rep2},\"RequestedRepresentation\"->mu,\n     \"TensorProductMultiplicity\"->multiplicity,\n     \"HighestWeightNullity\"->Lookup[hws,\"Nullity\",Missing[\"NotAvailable\"]]|>]]];\n\n totalDimension=dim[rep1] dim[rep2];\n psi=Normal@SparseArray[Thread[hws[\"Support\"]->hws[\"Ratios\"]],totalDimension];\n tuples=Select[ProjectiveExponentTuplesUpTo[s],\n   !ProjectiveVectorZeroQ[ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialBra[rep1,rep2,#]]&];\n allOverlaps=Association@Table[\n   n->ProjectiveFirstSiteMonomialOverlap[psi,rep1,rep2,n],{n,tuples}];\n compatibleTuples=Select[tuples,ProjectiveExponentWeight[rep1,#]+rep2===mu&];\n compatibleOverlaps=KeyTake[allOverlaps,compatibleTuples];\n nonzeroOverlaps=Select[compatibleOverlaps,!TrueQ[PossibleZeroQ[#]]&];\n If[Length[nonzeroOverlaps]==0,Return[Failure[\"NoNonzeroFirstSiteOverlap\",\n   <|\"InputRepresentations\"->{rep1,rep2},\"RequestedRepresentation\"->mu,\n     \"WeightCompatibleOverlaps\"->compatibleOverlaps|>]]];\n normalizationTuple=First@Keys[nonzeroOverlaps];\n normalizationValue=nonzeroOverlaps[normalizationTuple];\n projectiveRatios=Map[FullSimplify[#/normalizationValue]&,compatibleOverlaps];\n generatingPolynomial=ProjectiveFirstSiteGeneratingOverlap[\n   psi,rep1,rep2,{u13,u14,u23,u24}];\n\n <|\"InputRepresentations\"->{rep1,rep2},\"Representation\"->mu,\n   \"TensorProductMultiplicity\"->multiplicity,\"HighestWeightDimension\"->1,\n   \"BraDefinition\"->HoldForm[bra[n13,n14,n23,n24,0,0,0,0]==\n     braHWS.E13^n13.E14^n14.E23^n23.E24^n24],\n   \"TensorBasisNormalization\"->\"First nonzero HWS tensor component equals 1\",\n   \"HWSVector\"->psi,\"AllMonomialOverlaps\"->allOverlaps,\n   \"WeightCompatibleOverlaps\"->compatibleOverlaps,\n   \"NonzeroWeightCompatibleOverlaps\"->nonzeroOverlaps,\n   \"ProjectiveNormalizationTuple\"->normalizationTuple,\n   \"ProjectiveNormalizationValue\"->normalizationValue,\n   \"ProjectiveOverlapRatios\"->projectiveRatios,\n   \"GeneratingPolynomialVariables\"->{u13,u14,u23,u24},\n   \"GeneratingPolynomial\"->generatingPolynomial,\n   \"CartanExact\"->True,\"HighestWeightExact\"->hws[\"Exact\"]|>\n];\n\nFirstSiteHWSOverlapSuite[s_Integer?Positive,p_Integer?Positive]:=Module[\n {rep1={s,s,0,0},rep2={p,p,0,0},decomposition,results},\n decomposition=Association@tensorDecomp[rep1,rep2];\n results=Association@Table[mu->FirstSiteHWSOverlaps[s,p,mu],{mu,Keys[decomposition]}];\n <|\"InputRepresentations\"->{rep1,rep2},\"Decomposition\"->decomposition,\n   \"Results\"->results,\"AllSucceeded\"->FreeQ[results,_Failure]|>\n];\n\nfirstSiteHWSAPITests=Module[{suite11=FirstSiteHWSOverlapSuite[1,1],\n suite12=FirstSiteHWSOverlapSuite[1,2],exceptional},\n exceptional=suite12[\"Results\"][{2,2,1,1}];\n <|\"s1p1AllSucceeded\"->suite11[\"AllSucceeded\"],\n   \"s1p2AllSucceeded\"->suite12[\"AllSucceeded\"],\n   \"ExceptionalRawOverlaps\"->exceptional[\"WeightCompatibleOverlaps\"],\n   \"ExceptionalProjectiveRatios\"->exceptional[\"ProjectiveOverlapRatios\"],\n   \"ExceptionalGeneratingPolynomial\"->exceptional[\"GeneratingPolynomial\"],\n   \"ExpectedExceptionalOverlaps\"->TrueQ[\n     exceptional[\"WeightCompatibleOverlaps\"]==\n       <|{0,1,1,0}->-18,{1,0,0,1}->18|>],\n   \"AllTestsExact\"->TrueQ[suite11[\"AllSucceeded\"]&&suite12[\"AllSucceeded\"]&&\n     exceptional[\"ProjectiveOverlapRatios\"]==\n       <|{0,1,1,0}->1,{1,0,0,1}->-1|>]|>\n];\n\nfirstSiteHWSAPITests\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"765692\" data-output-id=\"72\" data-out-n=\"257\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"245\" data-sub-start=\"76\" data-sub-end=\"76\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[257]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.2em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s1p1AllSucceeded</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s1p2AllSucceeded</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ExceptionalRawOverlaps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ExceptionalProjectiveRatios</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ExceptionalGeneratingPolynomial</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">23</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ExpectedExceptionalOverlaps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AllTestsExact</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
